{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1791341022, "command": "bash demo/run.sh", "title": "VPC Networking Lab: real local traffic, NAT, fault and repair", "duration": 87.859261}
[0.009303, "o", "VPC Networking Lab | recorded local IPv4 demonstration\r\n\r\noutside 203.0.113.10 -> edge web mapping 203.0.113.20\r\n  -> public Nginx 10.0.1.10:80 -> private app 10.0.2.10:8080\r\n  -> isolated PostgreSQL 10.0.3.10:5432\r\n\r\nprivate egress: app -> router table 102 -> NAT 10.0.1.20\r\n  -> router table 101 -> edge mapping 203.0.113.30 -> outside\r\nThe outside fixture is sealed; these are documentation addresses.\r\n"]
[5.011348, "o", "\r\n$ bash lab.sh up\r\n"]
[5.254779, "o", "Lab created: eight namespaces, subnet routing, public mappings, and private NAT.\r\n"]
[8.257886, "o", "\r\n$ ip -n vpc-router rule show "]
[8.258776, "o", "\r\n"]
[9.261183, "o", "0:\tfrom all lookup local\r\n101:\tfrom all iif public lookup 101\r\n102:\tfrom all iif private lookup 102\r\n103:\tfrom all iif isolated lookup 103\r\n"]
[9.261974, "o", "32766:\tfrom all lookup main\r\n32767:\tfrom all lookup default\r\n"]
[12.264918, "o", "\r\n$ ip -n vpc-router route show table 101 "]
[12.267299, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.266833, "o", "default via 198.51.100.1 dev edge \r\n10.0.1.0/24 dev public scope link \r\n"]
[13.267449, "o", "10.0.2.0/24 dev private scope link \r\n10.0.3.0/24 dev isolated scope link \r\n198.51.100.0/30 dev edge scope link \r\n"]
[16.268066, "o", "\r\n$ ip -n vpc-router route show table 102 \r\n"]
[17.270152, "o", "default via 10.0.1.20 dev public \r\n10.0.1.0/24 dev public scope link \r\n10.0.2.0/24 dev private scope link \r\n"]
[17.270808, "o", "10.0.3.0/24 dev isolated scope link \r\n"]
[20.271214, "o", "\r\n$ ip -n vpc-router route show table 103 \r\n"]
[21.273259, "o", "unreachable default \r\n"]
[21.273875, "o", "10.0.1.0/24 dev public scope link \r\n10.0.2.0/24 dev private scope link \r\n10.0.3.0/24 dev isolated scope link \r\n"]
[24.275473, "o", "\r\nStarting the real Nginx, Python, and PostgreSQL services...\r\n"]
[27.229259, "o", "\r\n$ ip netns exec vpc-internet python3 tests/services.py get 203.0.113.20 80 /message "]
[27.230256, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.55239, "o", "{\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"message\": \"Hello from the isolated subnet\", \"peer\": \"10.0.1.10\"}}\r\n"]
[31.55908, "o", "\r\n$ env PYTHONPATH=tests python3 -c from\\ services\\ import\\ http\\;\\ assert\\ http\\(\\\"vpc-internet\\\"\\,\\ \\\"203.0.113.20\\\"\\,\\ 80\\,\\ \\\"/message\\\"\\)\\[\\\"message\\\"\\]\\ ==\\ \\\"Hello\\ from\\ the\\ isolated\\ subnet\\\"\\;\\ print\\(\\\"PASS:\\ proxy\\ returns\\ a\\ real\\ PostgreSQL\\ row\\\"\\) \r\n"]
[33.341104, "o", "PASS: proxy returns a real PostgreSQL row\r\n"]
[36.347891, "o", "\r\n$ env PYTHONPATH=tests python3 -c from\\ traffic\\ import\\ capture_nat\\;\\ capture_nat\\(\\) \r\n"]
[38.028446, "o", "PACKET: 02:44:20.307155 IP 10.0.2.10.48026 > 203.0.113.10.8080: Flags [S], seq 1293849021, win 64240, options [mss 1460,sackOK,TS val 1447316175 ecr 0,nop,wscale 10], length 0\r\nPACKET: 02:44:20.307203 IP 10.0.1.20.48026 > 203.0.113.10.8080: Flags [S], seq 1293849021, win 64240, options [mss 1460,sackOK,TS val 1447316175 ecr 0,nop,wscale 10], length 0\r\n"]
[38.029774, "o", "PACKET: 02:44:20.307214 IP 203.0.113.30.48026 > 203.0.113.10.8080: Flags [S], seq 1293849021, win 64240, options [mss 1460,sackOK,TS val 1447316175 ecr 0,nop,wscale 10], length 0\r\n"]
[38.060166, "o", "PACKET: 02:44:20.307250 IP 203.0.113.10.8080 > 10.0.2.10.48026: Flags [S.], seq 3104908347, ack 1293849022, win 65160, options [mss 1460,sackOK,TS val 3385132003 ecr 1447316175,nop,wscale 10], length 0\r\nHTTP: client ['10.0.2.10', 48026] observed as 203.0.113.30:48026\r\n"]
[38.065457, "o", "CONNTRACK vpc-nat: tcp      6 119 TIME_WAIT src=10.0.2.10 dst=203.0.113.10 sport=48026 dport=8080 src=203.0.113.10 dst=10.0.1.20 sport=8080 dport=48026 [ASSURED] mark=0 use=1\r\n"]
[38.070121, "o", "CONNTRACK vpc-edge: tcp      6 119 TIME_WAIT src=10.0.1.20 dst=203.0.113.10 sport=48026 dport=8080 src=203.0.113.10 dst=203.0.113.30 sport=8080 dport=48026 [ASSURED] mark=0 use=1\r\nPASS: HTTP, four packet captures, and conntrack prove both NAT translations and the reply\r\n"]
[41.079881, "o", "\r\nBreak only private external access; keep the internal DB path healthy.\r\n\r\n"]
[41.082072, "o", "$ bash lab.sh fault private-route \r\n"]
[42.117858, "o", "fault: private-route\r\n"]
[45.119928, "o", "\r\n$ ip -n vpc-router route show table 102 \r\n"]
[46.123279, "o", "unreachable default \r\n"]
[46.124265, "o", "10.0.1.0/24 dev public scope link \r\n10.0.2.0/24 dev private scope link \r\n10.0.3.0/24 dev isolated scope link \r\n"]
[49.126284, "o", "\r\n$ env PYTHONPATH=tests python3 -c from\\ traffic\\ import\\ request\\;\\ request\\(\\\"vpc-internet\\\"\\,\\ \\\"203.0.113.10\\\"\\,\\ peer=\\\"203.0.113.10\\\"\\)\\;\\ request\\(\\\"vpc-app\\\"\\,\\ \\\"203.0.113.10\\\"\\,\\ denied=True\\)\\;\\ print\\(\\\"PASS:\\ healthy\\ outside\\ fixture\\;\\ new\\ app\\ HTTP\\ connection\\ denied\\\"\\) \r\n"]
[51.38163, "o", "PASS: healthy outside fixture; new app HTTP connection denied\r\n"]
[54.388164, "o", "\r\n$ ip netns exec vpc-internet python3 tests/services.py get 203.0.113.20 80 /message \r\n"]
[55.564033, "o", "{\"status\": 200, \"body\": {\"message\": \"Hello from the isolated subnet\", \"peer\": \"10.0.1.10\"}}\r\n"]
[58.571362, "o", "\r\n$ env PYTHONPATH=tests python3 -c from\\ services\\ import\\ http\\;\\ assert\\ http\\(\\\"vpc-internet\\\"\\,\\ \\\"203.0.113.20\\\"\\,\\ 80\\,\\ \\\"/message\\\"\\)\\[\\\"message\\\"\\]\\ ==\\ \\\"Hello\\ from\\ the\\ isolated\\ subnet\\\"\\;\\ print\\(\\\"PASS:\\ internal\\ PostgreSQL\\ request\\ survives\\ the\\ missing\\ external\\ route\\\"\\) "]
[58.572824, "o", "\r\n"]
[60.283434, "o", "PASS: internal PostgreSQL request survives the missing external route\r\n"]
[63.289487, "o", "\r\n$ bash lab.sh repair private-route \r\n"]
[64.333015, "o", "repair: private-route\r\n"]
[67.335834, "o", "\r\n$ ip netns exec vpc-app python3 tests/traffic.py request 203.0.113.10 8080 \r\n"]
[68.449773, "o", "{\"peer\": \"203.0.113.30\", \"peer_port\": 37226, \"client\": [\"10.0.2.10\", 37226]}\r\n"]
[71.458386, "o", "\r\n$ env PYTHONPATH=tests python3 -c from\\ traffic\\ import\\ request\\;\\ request\\(\\\"vpc-app\\\"\\,\\ \\\"203.0.113.10\\\"\\,\\ peer=\\\"203.0.113.30\\\"\\)\\;\\ print\\(\\\"PASS:\\ repaired\\ route\\ restores\\ fresh\\ HTTP\\ through\\ both\\ NAT\\ translations\\\"\\) \r\n"]
[73.26171, "o", "PASS: repaired route restores fresh HTTP through both NAT translations\r\n"]
[76.268748, "o", "\r\nEarlier live AWS evidence, recorded October 5 (this is a file, not a live deployment):\r\n"]
[76.269476, "o", "\r\n$ sed -n 17\\,30p evidence/aws-faults-2026-10-05.md \r\n"]
[77.275763, "o", "| Case | Run 1 / run 2 duration | Observed failure | Healthy control and recovery |\r\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\r\n| App NAT default deleted | 14.750 / 14.843 s | Fresh app TCP 443 timed out in 3.003 s in both runs; AWS default was absent | `/health` and DB-backed `/message` stayed HTTP 200; external TCP connected after route repair |\r\n| DB security-group port changed to 5433 | 19.406 / 18.672 s | App TCP 5432 timed out in 3.003 s; `/message` returned HTTP 503 | Local DB query and `/health` remained healthy; restoring 5432 on the same rule ID restored HTTP 200 |\r\n| DB NACL app return rule removed | 50.703 / 50.453 s | App TCP 5432 timed out in 3.003 s; `/message` returned HTTP 503 | Custom NACL first passed HTTP 200; restoring its return rule restored HTTP 200 before returning to the default NACL |\r\n\r\nTotal run times were **176.844 s** and **176.985 s**, including complete live\r\nbaseline checks before and after the faults. The security-group case showed\r\nthe probed SYN leaving app and absent from DB's capture while DB's local\r\nquery succeeded. The NACL case showed that same connection's SYN reaching\r\nDB and its SYN-ACK leaving DB, with no matching SYN-ACK received by app.\r\nThe NACL retained web SSH ingress and its separate reply rule throughout.\r\n\r\nRun 2's return-port capture excerpt, with sequence/options omitted:\r\n"]
[80.278868, "o", "\r\nStopping this demo and removing its owned namespaces...\r\n"]
[80.763435, "o", "\r\n$ bash lab.sh down \r\n"]
[81.829427, "o", "Lab removed.\r\n"]
[84.834156, "o", "\r\nPASS: demo completed; services stopped; no namespaces remain.\r\n"]
